pageViews
| where timestamp > ago(7d)
| where name has "Sales Order"
| summarize
    avgDurationMS = round(avg(duration), 0)
  , p95DurationMS = round(percentile(duration, 95), 0)
  , pageLoads     = count()
  by usertelemetryId = user_Id
| order by avgDurationMS desc
//Network problem signature: 
//A small subset of users is consistently slow while others on the same environment are fast. 
//This points to client location, ISP, or VPN — not BC.

//BC server problem signature: 
//All users experience similar slowness regardless of location, or slowness correlates with time of day (batch job windows, peak usage).